<mxfile host="Electron" type="device"><diagram name="Overview" id="overview"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1240" pageHeight="600" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="One round of the Muse agent: a swarm explores, then builds" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="One Muse Code session on the branch &lt;i&gt;muse-agent&lt;/i&gt;, with up to 12 agents at once. The lead coordinates and is the only agent that commits; helpers explore, verify, build and check boundaries. The source of truth is the skill, .agents/skills/muse-round/ (version 6). Each round writes in its own folder, &amp;lt;round&amp;gt;/: round 1 at the top of muse-spark/, round N in muse-spark/round-&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;/." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="52" width="1180" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;0&amp;ndash;1  Where you are, the starting point&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The round from the tags muse-round-&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;; from round 2, a starting point from Claude's G3: each slot's baseline or, without one, the attempt to start from" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="110" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Exploration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Explorers, one per territory, and a verifier write a shared analysis; from round 2, on those attempts and what G3 reopened" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="110" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;3  The analysis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Once every territory is done and every inefficiency settled, the lead writes the final, ranked README" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="110" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;4  Implementation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Per inefficiency: a boundary, 2&amp;ndash;3 competing builders, then hardening; from round 2, each must also beat its slot's baseline, if it has one" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="110" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;5  Finish&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Once nothing left pays: final READMEs, the round's summary.md, &amp;quot;Round N finished&amp;quot;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="110" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;Claude, after the round&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;merge muse-agent into main (--no-ff), re-run G1 and G2, run G3 at 1, 8 and 32 requests, write claude/findings/muse-round-&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;.md, tag muse-round-&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: its files freeze" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="270" width="460" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1090" y="305"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="next round" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="130" y="305"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;round&amp;gt;/exploration/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;README.md, the analysis (versioned) · territory-*.md · ineff-*.md · log.md" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="380" width="440" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;round&amp;gt;/implementation/&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;round&amp;gt;/kernels/&amp;lt;slot&amp;gt;/attempt-&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;README.md, the report (versioned) · hyp-*.md · log.md · graded attempts" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="380" width="460" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;Git, the branch muse-agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;one commit per checkpoint, &amp;quot;&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;: &amp;lt;phase&amp;gt; v&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: …&amp;quot;, with the model's co-author; the hooks keep every commit in the round's folder and freeze finished rounds" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#36393d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="470" width="940" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="Lead" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="380" width="200" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="Exploration" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="420" width="200" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="Implementation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="460" width="200" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="Claude" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="500" width="200" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Exploration" id="exploration"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1240" pageHeight="880" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="Exploration: steps 2 and 3" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="600" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="Explorers map their territory and post every inefficiency they find; every agent reads the shared folder before each task, and changes direction when the others' work shows its own is redundant, refuted or worth less. Shown: round 1's eight territories. From round 2, the starting point picks them: each slot's baseline or starting attempt, and what G3 reopened." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="52" width="1180" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Explorers, one per territory, in parallel" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=4;startSize=26;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;swimlaneFillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="130" width="300" height="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;mobilemoe.py: the layer around the slots" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="36" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-switch-layers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;switch_layers.py: the routed experts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="100" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-quantized-kernels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;MLX quantized.h: affine_gather_*" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="164" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-other-kernels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;MLX sort, softmax, reductions" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="228" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-vllm-metal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;vllm-metal: the decode step around it" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="292" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-grader&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bench/grader/: the slot interface" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="356" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-findings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;claude/findings/, the breakdown run" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="420" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;explorer-runs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GPU-counter, baseline, micro runs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="12" y="484" width="276" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;verifier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;checks each open inefficiency against its sources: file and lines, table row, arithmetic" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="720" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&amp;lt;round&amp;gt;/exploration/: shared and live" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=4;startSize=26;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;swimlaneFillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="130" width="380" height="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;README.md&lt;/b&gt;: the analysis; only the lead writes it&lt;br&gt;version line (vN, skill version) · tracker · context · territory map · ranked inefficiencies · recommendations · refuted claims · ## Versions" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="15" y="40" width="350" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;territory-&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.md&lt;/b&gt;, one per territory&lt;br&gt;status block: owner, status, version, updated, next · the checklist for every piece of code · relations · files read" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="15" y="175" width="350" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;ineff-&amp;lt;territory&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;.md&lt;/b&gt;, one per inefficiency&lt;br&gt;slot · where (file:lines) · cost at 1, 8 and 32 rows · kind · predicted saving · Verdict" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="15" y="300" width="350" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;log.md&lt;/b&gt;: one line per event, appended by every agent&lt;br&gt;time | agent | posted, noted, changed direction, confirmed, finished" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="15" y="425" width="350" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;Lead: a checkpoint each time a helper returns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1  read the log&lt;br&gt;2  settle clashes (supersede, redirect)&lt;br&gt;3  refresh the tracker&lt;br&gt;4  raise the README version&lt;br&gt;5  commit the folder" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="130" width="280" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;muse-agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;: exploration v&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: …" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#36393d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="320" width="220" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;Refocus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;split a territory whose cost sits in one file, merge or add one, and start its explorer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="430" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="start, redirect, refocus" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1070" y="108"/><mxPoint x="180" y="108"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="write own entry" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=1;exitY=0.43;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="post" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=1;exitY=0.65;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="append" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=1;exitY=0.87;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="read before&lt;br&gt;every task" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.17;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.17;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="verdict" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.8;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c16"><mxGeometry x="-0.75" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="400" y="760"/><mxPoint x="400" y="518"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="writes README" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.18;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="reads" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.85;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="895" y="610"/><mxPoint x="895" y="266"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="commit" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;b&gt;Adapting, every agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Before every new task and after every post, read the tracker and the newest 30 log lines. Change direction when another entry covers the item, its premise was refuted, or an unowned item predicts a larger saving (µs per decode step at 1, 8 and 32 rows). Log why." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="720" width="380" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="&lt;b&gt;Done when&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;every territory entry is done, the verifier has returned, and every inefficiency is confirmed, refuted or superseded. Then the lead writes the final analysis." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="720" width="280" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Implementation" id="implementation"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1240" pageHeight="1000" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="Implementation: step 4" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="600" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="The confirmed inefficiencies are taken in rank order, at most two at a time and in different slots. For each, competing builders write and grade solutions inside a boundary that keeps the steps before and after the slot unchanged, and the best one is hardened until it is ready for G3." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="52" width="1180" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;Ranked inefficiencies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;from exploration/README.md" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="110" width="220" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;The lead opens hyp-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;slug&amp;gt;.md&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;status: boundary · the inefficiency and its slot" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="110" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;boundary-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt; writes the Boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;slot inputs and outputs, shapes and dtypes at decode and prefill sizes · bit for bit: rounding points, sum order, tie rule · what runs before and after · what G2 can't see · GPU limits" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="100" width="280" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Builders compete: 2 or 3, each in a different direction (status: building)" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=4;startSize=26;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;swimlaneFillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="240" width="850" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;builder-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-a&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1  claim attempt-N (mkdir)&lt;br&gt;2  write kernels and notes.md with a prediction&lt;br&gt;3  grade it (check_candidate.py)&lt;br&gt;4  record G1, G2, timings&lt;br&gt;5  explain a miss over 20%" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="c8"><mxGeometry x="15" y="40" width="264" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;builder-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-b&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1  claim attempt-N (mkdir)&lt;br&gt;2  write kernels and notes.md with a prediction&lt;br&gt;3  grade it (check_candidate.py)&lt;br&gt;4  record G1, G2, timings&lt;br&gt;5  explain a miss over 20%" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="c8"><mxGeometry x="293" y="40" width="264" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;builder-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-c&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1  claim attempt-N (mkdir)&lt;br&gt;2  write kernels and notes.md with a prediction&lt;br&gt;3  grade it (check_candidate.py)&lt;br&gt;4  record G1, G2, timings&lt;br&gt;5  explain a miss over 20%" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="c8"><mxGeometry x="571" y="40" width="264" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.91;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;GPU queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;one grader run at a time;&lt;br&gt;a second run waits its turn" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.08;fontSize=11;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#36393d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="335" y="495" width="310" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="step 3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;Lead checkpoint&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;commit the attempt with the hypothesis entry: &amp;quot;&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;: implementation v&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: …&amp;quot;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="240" width="220" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="returns" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=1;exitY=0.45;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;boundary-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt; checks&lt;/b&gt; each attempt that passed G2: other row counts, unwritten threadgroup memory, timing-dependent results" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="390" width="220" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="Best attempt passes G1, G2 and its boundary check, and beats compiled at 1, 8 and 32 rows, and any baseline?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="600" width="360" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1100" y="685"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;b&gt;Harden&lt;/b&gt; (status: hardening)&lt;br&gt;a builder makes the best attempt's next single change" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="640" width="280" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="no, or a change&lt;br&gt;still worth making" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.18;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;ready&lt;/b&gt;: the Decision names the attempt and what G3 should show; or &lt;b&gt;dropped&lt;/b&gt;, with why" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="820" width="300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#36393d;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="next-ranked inefficiency" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="30" y="855"/><mxPoint x="30" y="150"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;round&amp;gt;/implementation/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;README.md: version line · tracker (attempts: G1, G2, µs against compiled and any baseline) · hypotheses · Ready to test · ## Versions&lt;br&gt;hyp-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;slug&amp;gt;.md · log.md" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="760" width="260" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;round&amp;gt;/kernels/&amp;lt;slot&amp;gt;/attempt-&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;launch spec and Metal source in the brief's layout · notes.md: change, cause, prediction, verdict" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="890" width="260" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
